Benarkah?

890
00:57:59,273 --> 00:58:00,856
Lihat.

891
00:58:05,856 --> 00:58:07,023
Lihat.

892
00:58:07,773 --> 00:58:10,106
Kami bertiga.
Itu aku.

893
00:58:10,273 --> 00:58:11,773
Jadi dia seorang aktris?

894
